2. Unicode Common Locale Data Repository (CLDR), release 49
   https://github.com/unicode-org/cldr
   File: common/subdivisions/de.xml
   Used for: German names that Debian iso-codes does not translate or marks
   as fuzzy (data/names/de.php).
   License: Unicode License v3 (LICENSES/Unicode-3.0.txt).
   Copyright © 1991-2025 Unicode, Inc.

The data files were changed only in form: converted to PHP arrays by
tools/generate.php, which also states which source each German name comes
from. The dates of changes are in the Git history. To rebuild them, run
`composer generate`; the sources are pinned with their SHA-256 in
tools/sources.php.
